From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 12:51:10 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] feat: Spatial voice, Sing's voice held in front while the
 instruments play around you

The voice is placed by a small head model (time, level and shadow between the ears, distance, a short room) and follows
the yaw of head-tracking AirPods, so it stays put as you turn; it comes back in front after a time or never. The
instrumental is widened or narrowed. Mod Settings > Karaoke > Spatial voice has the switch, a picture and the sliders.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
